ico lands on the planet Galeade, where he meets the members of his new squadron under the command of Barkoff... but for what purpose have they been brought together?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-10-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":30,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zxQk7Q2tUtFUJdtwNjdj5mRJuhh.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zxQk7Q2tUtFUJdtwNjdj5mRJuhh.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/32377/season/0/episode/14"},{"id":"2031354","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumber":15,"title":{"value":"Episodio 15","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"A fifth member is added to Barkoff's team, but is he an asset or a liability?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-12-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":30,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qjaMaWOAFHljAkSTYgeMqlFgdiv.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qjaMaWOAFHljAkSTYgeMqlFgdiv.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/32377/season/0/episode/15"},{"id":"2031355","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Episodio 16","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"A botched mission leads to disastrous consequences for the Gilgamesh Army.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-12-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":30,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jfwZGFGhd98WzvWYjoDYMT4Rmtm.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jfwZGFGhd98WzvWYjoDYMT4Rmtm.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/32377/season/0/episode/16"},{"id":"2031356","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Episodio 17","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Defiant against even insurmountable opposition, Pailsen resists attempts at interrogation, but his silence is no match for the insidious MRC device.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-02-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":30,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xu4fRE3S6SYY8cyItBW0NhdaiXE.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xu4fRE3S6SYY8cyItBW0NhdaiXE.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/32377/season/0/episode/17"},{"id":"2031357","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumber":18,"title":{"value":"Episodio 18","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"As the MRC continues its torturous work, Pailsen reveals the truth behind Chirico's seeming invincibility.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-02-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":30,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/coz97mU8TxmCvEzrliwd2xgUHMy.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/coz97mU8TxmCvEzrliwd2xgUHMy.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/32377/season/0/episode/18"},{"id":"2031358","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumber":19,"title":{"value":"Episodio 19","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Barkoff's team is ordered to a base near the planet's north pole, but a malfunction with their transport plane leaves them unexpectedly stranded.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-04-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":30,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hZuMFIRIfRN7DS8nPzX9mOyouVH.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hZuMFIRIfRN7DS8nPzX9mOyouVH.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/32377/season/0/episode/19"},{"id":"2031359","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumber":20,"title":{"value":"Episodio 20","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"A new crisis threatens to wipe out the planet's atmosphere, but the changing weather isn't the only threat looming on the horizon...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2008-04-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":30,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/15VXajKWYSPYiPWcylutJVzylGJ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url"